WEBVTT

00:00.520 --> 00:03.320
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.320 --> 00:05.910
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.580 --> 00:09.980
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.680 --> 00:14.690
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.060 --> 00:17.590
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:17.930 --> 00:21.370
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.120 --> 00:28.340
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.020 --> 00:34.100
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:34.900 --> 00:37.390
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.390 --> 00:40.000
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.520 --> 00:47.780
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.750 --> 00:51.510
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.570 --> 00:54.410
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.700 --> 00:55.730
♪Let me♪

00:55.920 --> 01:00.000
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.450 --> 01:03.130
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.420 --> 01:06.120
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.290 --> 01:07.760
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.760 --> 01:11.930
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.289 --> 01:22.539
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:23.970 --> 01:29.520
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.720 --> 01:32.539
=Episode 15=

01:45.979 --> 01:46.620
Today

01:47.340 --> 01:48.890
Is mother's birthday.

02:13.860 --> 02:14.420
Commander.

02:14.900 --> 02:15.740
Why are you here?

02:29.620 --> 02:30.840
Chu Zhao has something to do.

02:31.100 --> 02:31.900
He already left.

02:32.300 --> 02:33.140
He wrote a letter

02:33.500 --> 02:34.260
to you.

02:51.620 --> 02:52.260
Osmanthus candy.

02:53.300 --> 02:54.500
Eat one when you're sad.

02:55.340 --> 02:56.140
You'll feel better.

03:03.020 --> 03:03.900
Cheng Lisu told me.

03:16.100 --> 03:16.860
Thank you.

03:19.820 --> 03:20.380
Commander.

03:21.060 --> 03:22.020
Do you

03:22.300 --> 03:23.620
actually dislike osmanthus candy?

03:24.540 --> 03:26.020
But back at Xianchang Academy,

03:26.420 --> 03:27.780
you carried it with you every day.

03:28.220 --> 03:29.540
How did you know

03:30.620 --> 03:31.700
about that?

03:38.500 --> 03:39.540
I heard it from others.

03:47.820 --> 03:48.660
It's true.

03:50.620 --> 03:51.380
When I was young,

03:52.100 --> 03:53.380
my mother gave me a pouch.

03:54.579 --> 03:56.120
It was filled with osmanthus candies.

03:57.060 --> 03:58.500
I carried that pouch everywhere.

03:59.420 --> 04:00.180
Seeing this,

04:01.380 --> 04:03.220
she often made me more candies.

04:05.300 --> 04:06.380
Yet after growing up,

04:06.780 --> 04:08.260
I stopped liking sweets.

04:09.300 --> 04:10.220
But my mother

04:12.100 --> 04:13.060
made those candies.

04:18.899 --> 04:19.860
So, the candies

04:21.620 --> 04:22.740
must have been delicious.

04:23.980 --> 04:24.660
Sure.

04:27.260 --> 04:27.900
Very delicious.

04:36.500 --> 04:37.690
If you don't want to smile,

04:38.500 --> 04:39.380
you don't have to.

04:40.580 --> 04:41.260
People

04:41.820 --> 04:43.340
have moments of vulnerability.

04:49.690 --> 04:50.190
Okay.

04:51.100 --> 04:51.820
It's truly sweet.

04:54.140 --> 04:54.659
Commander.

04:55.140 --> 04:56.060
Have you ever

04:56.340 --> 04:57.900
given osmanthus candy to others before?

05:01.660 --> 05:02.500
I did once.

05:03.380 --> 05:04.420
It was the last candy

05:04.420 --> 05:05.140
my mother made.

05:08.540 --> 05:09.540
It wasn't my first time

05:09.540 --> 05:10.900
receiving candy from someone.

05:11.740 --> 05:13.260
I gave it to a blind girl

05:14.620 --> 05:16.180
contemplating suicide at Yuhua Temple.

05:18.580 --> 05:19.860
(This is osmanthus candy.)

05:21.380 --> 05:22.100
The last one

05:22.740 --> 05:23.770
remaining in this world.

05:25.180 --> 05:26.340
Though it's inedible now,

05:27.020 --> 05:28.140
its sweetness remains.

05:34.860 --> 05:36.300
If it was the last one,

05:37.860 --> 05:38.900
why did you give it away?

05:44.460 --> 05:45.180
To me,

05:46.180 --> 05:46.820
that candy

05:47.540 --> 05:49.540
represented desire and hope.

05:50.820 --> 05:52.300
It was better to give it away

05:54.100 --> 05:55.620
and pacify someone else.

05:58.140 --> 05:59.060
Is tonight's moon

05:59.620 --> 06:00.420
beautiful?

06:15.260 --> 06:16.300
The moon is bright.

06:18.420 --> 06:19.420
The breeze is gentle.

06:21.900 --> 06:23.260
It's quite a serene scene.

06:39.900 --> 06:40.620
Commander.

06:41.100 --> 06:42.300
Let me give you candy too.

06:44.060 --> 06:44.659
Eat this,

06:45.500 --> 06:46.580
and you'll feel better.

06:51.980 --> 06:53.500
You're regifting my own candy

06:54.540 --> 06:55.420
to me?

06:57.560 --> 06:58.500
Commander,

06:59.220 --> 07:00.300
your words completely

07:00.900 --> 07:02.360
ruin the moment.

07:20.620 --> 07:21.820
If you're going to Jiyang,

07:22.220 --> 07:23.380
go as a new identity.

07:23.740 --> 07:24.780
But last night you said

07:24.900 --> 07:26.180
you didn't think of a good one.

07:27.100 --> 07:28.100
Yet we must go

07:28.100 --> 07:29.140
to Jiyang at once.

07:32.820 --> 07:34.260
Commander, I know

07:34.820 --> 07:35.800
Chai Anxi is in Jiyang.

07:36.220 --> 07:37.300
We must go.

07:37.620 --> 07:38.380
I have an idea.

07:38.380 --> 07:39.180
I'll go

07:39.260 --> 07:40.409
to Jiyang first as a scout.

07:40.860 --> 07:41.460
You can go

07:41.500 --> 07:42.860
once you get a suitable identity.

07:46.620 --> 07:47.700
The identity is secured.

07:48.460 --> 07:49.260
It's done?

07:51.260 --> 07:51.940
I'll use that.

07:54.060 --> 07:55.620
But how?

07:56.060 --> 07:56.940
Do your arrangements.

07:57.340 --> 07:58.140
I have my resources.

07:58.490 --> 07:59.030
Yes.

08:01.300 --> 08:02.380
Mr. Feinu

08:02.540 --> 08:03.940
seems awkward.

08:06.300 --> 08:06.820
Commander.

08:07.980 --> 08:09.540
Are you planning

08:10.140 --> 08:11.660
to use some dishonorable identity?

08:26.860 --> 08:27.620
Do you like me?

08:42.460 --> 08:43.100
No.

08:46.300 --> 08:47.060
I don't.

08:56.860 --> 08:57.660
Good then.

09:00.180 --> 09:00.860
Good?

09:02.540 --> 09:03.500
What's good about it?

09:06.060 --> 09:07.140
For the trip to Jiyang,

09:07.540 --> 09:08.140
I'll pretend

09:08.780 --> 09:10.460
to be Qiao Huanqing,
nephew of Cui Yuezhi,

09:10.460 --> 09:11.620
a loyal subordinate

09:12.300 --> 09:13.100
under the princess.

09:13.980 --> 09:15.420
Qiao Huanqing was lost as a child

09:15.620 --> 09:17.110
and was adopted by a kind merchant.

09:17.620 --> 09:18.300
Cui Yuezhi

09:18.380 --> 09:19.260
has known where he is.

09:19.700 --> 09:20.900
So, he wrote to invite him

09:20.900 --> 09:21.740
back to Jiyang.

09:23.300 --> 09:23.980
However,

09:24.540 --> 09:25.380
Qiao Huanqing

09:25.860 --> 09:27.500
just got married.

09:29.580 --> 09:32.410
So, I'll be impersonating...

09:32.580 --> 09:33.340
Mrs. Qiao.

09:39.500 --> 09:40.860
Qiao Huanqing's wife's name

09:41.740 --> 09:42.810
is Wen Yuyan.

09:43.580 --> 09:45.100
She's a renowned, talented woman.

09:45.740 --> 09:47.780
Qiao Huanqing likes her very much,

09:47.780 --> 09:49.140
often boasting about her.

09:50.060 --> 09:51.460
Therefore, he'll undoubtedly

09:52.020 --> 09:53.420
go to Jiyang with his wife.

09:57.850 --> 09:58.720
Alright.

09:58.820 --> 10:01.300
If we're acting,
we must make it look real.

10:01.940 --> 10:02.900
But I have a question.

10:03.260 --> 10:03.860
Look,

10:04.180 --> 10:05.380
I don't

10:05.860 --> 10:07.290
look like a talented lady

10:07.820 --> 10:09.420
whatsoever.

10:10.980 --> 10:13.020
Maybe I should go to Jiyang first

10:13.140 --> 10:14.300
as your vanguard.

10:15.780 --> 10:16.740
Feinu will

10:17.180 --> 10:18.340
have someone else do that.

10:19.220 --> 10:20.140
Your current mission

10:20.340 --> 10:21.420
is to transform yourself

10:21.420 --> 10:22.100
into a good lady.

10:22.820 --> 10:23.540
Be an average lady

10:24.380 --> 10:25.140
at least.

10:26.100 --> 10:26.860
You should

10:27.540 --> 10:28.740
at least know some talent.

10:29.620 --> 10:30.860
Show your strongest skill

10:31.820 --> 10:32.730
and practice it.

10:52.460 --> 10:52.980
Done.

10:53.500 --> 10:54.980
This is your strongest skill?

10:55.380 --> 10:55.910
Sure.

10:56.780 --> 10:58.260
This character's eight strokes

10:58.700 --> 11:00.180
best showcase foundational skills.

11:04.980 --> 11:06.420
(If I weren't afraid)

11:06.420 --> 11:08.100
(you'd recognize my handwriting,)

11:08.660 --> 11:10.260
(would I need to hide my ability?)

11:49.780 --> 11:50.380
Commander.

11:50.820 --> 11:52.660
I'm trying my best.

11:57.180 --> 11:58.220
Let me draw maps instead.

11:58.620 --> 11:59.460
That's where I excel.

11:59.580 --> 12:01.260
No one could possibly surpass me.

12:04.620 --> 12:06.020
You're supposed to play Mrs. Qiao,

12:06.420 --> 12:07.540
not General Qiao.

12:23.860 --> 12:24.890
Among these instruments,

12:25.140 --> 12:26.390
is there any you're good at

12:29.700 --> 12:30.420
or passable with?

12:32.340 --> 12:33.720
The ones you know aren't here?

12:36.460 --> 12:37.300
Complete amateur.

12:45.340 --> 12:46.500
Then focus on guqin skills.

12:47.100 --> 12:48.420
At least learn one piece

12:48.780 --> 12:49.660
to bluff others.

12:50.520 --> 12:51.330
Alright.

12:53.140 --> 12:53.910
Will you teach me?

14:15.100 --> 14:21.540
♪Constant yearning,
still vivid as our first meeting♪

14:22.340 --> 14:28.700
♪Endless gazing.
Step by step, falling deeper♪

14:29.020 --> 14:36.790
♪How to untangle this love,
buried deep within dreams♪

14:37.620 --> 14:43.420
♪My heart, unyielding as stone,
remains true♪

14:43.950 --> 14:50.700
♪Awaiting the crescent moon's
reflection in your heart♪

14:50.700 --> 14:51.580
Your nervousness

14:53.180 --> 14:54.580
might make me think you fancy me.

14:57.500 --> 14:58.140
I...

15:01.340 --> 15:02.020
You are

15:02.780 --> 15:04.180
good-looking.

15:04.700 --> 15:06.340
Being so confident isn't surprising.

15:07.180 --> 15:08.780
But don't get me wrong.

15:09.300 --> 15:12.860
I'm just worried my bad playing

15:13.380 --> 15:15.060
will embarrass me publicly.

15:16.700 --> 15:17.820
Then practice harder.

15:18.650 --> 15:19.220
Hmm.

15:25.240 --> 15:26.540
Don't tense your hands.

15:27.580 --> 15:28.420
Drooping naturally.

15:31.220 --> 15:32.020
Just go with it.

15:32.500 --> 15:38.420
♪Shadows hustle. Scenes reappear♪

15:39.160 --> 15:47.180
♪What is there to fear?
We'll move forward together♪

15:47.740 --> 15:53.750
♪Through endless dawns and dusks,
to eternity♪

15:54.390 --> 15:58.200
♪Awaiting the crescent moon's
reflection in your heart.♪

15:58.420 --> 16:01.230
♪Splendor fades from your eyes♪

16:01.230 --> 16:08.340
♪Crimson threads entwine like rings,
binding our first vow♪

16:08.780 --> 16:12.870
♪Time lingers as you and I share
overlapping palm lines♪

16:12.870 --> 16:16.890
♪Zither and harp
accompany our dancing dreams♪

16:17.100 --> 16:23.700
♪The brocade moon writes our vow,
keeping this promise♪

16:46.900 --> 16:47.420
Commander.

16:47.740 --> 16:48.620
Any improvement?

16:52.180 --> 16:54.380
Your posture looks good now.

16:56.020 --> 16:56.820
My playing?

16:58.060 --> 16:58.700
The playing

17:00.220 --> 17:00.900
is very loud.

17:53.980 --> 17:54.940
Weird.

17:55.660 --> 17:56.860
Why does the sound

17:57.100 --> 17:58.780
differ so much from Commander's?

18:03.340 --> 18:04.380
Commander Xiao wants you

18:04.380 --> 18:05.020
to cross-dress,

18:05.380 --> 18:06.580
disregards your injuries,

18:06.740 --> 18:07.700
and forces you

18:07.700 --> 18:08.660
to practice.

18:09.980 --> 18:11.420
This is really too much!

18:12.700 --> 18:13.500
Miss Song.

18:13.580 --> 18:14.820
My injuries healed long ago.

18:14.820 --> 18:15.380
I'm good now.

18:15.900 --> 18:16.620
He.

18:16.860 --> 18:18.620
Stop speaking for Commander Xiao.

18:18.980 --> 18:20.150
The scent of blood on you

18:20.300 --> 18:21.260
won't escape my notice.

18:21.260 --> 18:22.420
I have a keen nose.

18:24.020 --> 18:24.820
I prepared

18:24.820 --> 18:25.700
a tonic for you.

18:26.340 --> 18:27.100
Later,

18:27.180 --> 18:28.260
I'll check your pulse.

18:29.060 --> 18:30.660
The quack, Cheng Lisu, can't be trusted.

18:31.020 --> 18:32.570
He actually said you fully recovered.

18:33.860 --> 18:34.860
No need for that.

18:35.300 --> 18:36.600
Mr. Cheng is a good physician.

18:36.700 --> 18:37.400
I'm good.

18:37.540 --> 18:38.900
His diagnosis must be accurate.

18:39.260 --> 18:39.900
He.

18:40.140 --> 18:41.340
My medical skills are good.

18:41.700 --> 18:43.020
You're avoiding treatment.

18:43.620 --> 18:44.660
Let me check your pulse.

18:44.660 --> 18:45.540
No, you don't...

18:45.940 --> 18:46.500
Let me do it.

18:46.500 --> 18:47.260
No need, Miss Song.

18:47.260 --> 18:47.860
Let me help.

18:47.860 --> 18:48.580
No need.

18:48.820 --> 18:49.340
Let me do it.

18:49.380 --> 18:50.100
No need.

18:50.180 --> 18:50.700
Come on.

18:50.740 --> 18:51.540
No, really.

18:51.820 --> 18:52.580
I...

19:10.900 --> 19:11.780
Miss Song.

19:12.180 --> 19:13.620
Well, let me explain.

19:13.820 --> 19:15.420
Well, Miss Song...

19:23.620 --> 19:24.120
Huaijin.

19:24.420 --> 19:24.980
Don't worry.

19:25.420 --> 19:26.740
I spent a fortune hiring

19:26.740 --> 19:27.500
a makeup artist.

19:27.780 --> 19:28.620
She'll make Miss He

19:28.780 --> 19:30.300
outshine everyone.

19:32.540 --> 19:33.500
I don't care.

19:34.460 --> 19:35.060
Look...

19:40.980 --> 19:41.850
What happened?

19:43.300 --> 19:45.140
Miss Song knows.

19:45.900 --> 19:46.620
About what?

19:48.340 --> 19:49.380
You. Come with me.

19:49.880 --> 19:50.420
All of you

19:50.540 --> 19:51.140
go in and wait.

20:00.540 --> 20:02.500
Utterly outrageous!

20:08.660 --> 20:09.340
Miss Song.

20:10.300 --> 20:11.900
Though I didn't mean to hide the fact

20:12.180 --> 20:13.300
that I am a woman,

20:14.180 --> 20:15.460
I did deceive you.

20:16.940 --> 20:17.780
If you're angry,

20:18.020 --> 20:18.900
vent your fury on me.

20:19.500 --> 20:20.380
You may even hit me.

20:20.460 --> 20:21.460
I won't fight back.

20:23.420 --> 20:24.100
Please.

20:24.420 --> 20:25.660
Are you asking for a beating?

20:26.300 --> 20:26.820
After all,

20:27.660 --> 20:29.020
it's my fault.

20:30.020 --> 20:30.860
Do you think

20:30.860 --> 20:31.980
I'm angry

20:32.020 --> 20:32.940
about your deception?

20:34.620 --> 20:35.540
Aren't you?

20:36.460 --> 20:37.500
Of course not!

20:38.020 --> 20:39.300
I understand your plight.

20:39.660 --> 20:41.540
A woman in the military faces hardships.

20:41.780 --> 20:43.340
Your caution is justified.

20:44.460 --> 20:45.300
I'm only upset

20:45.300 --> 20:46.300
that you don't trust me

20:46.580 --> 20:48.220
or tell me the truth sooner.

20:48.780 --> 20:50.020
Had you told me earlier,

20:50.220 --> 20:51.060
I could've started

20:51.060 --> 20:52.060
to nurse you earlier.

20:52.620 --> 20:54.100
He is skilled in women's health,

20:54.340 --> 20:55.660
but I'm much better than he is.

20:58.180 --> 20:58.820
Moreover,

20:59.820 --> 21:01.220
I can smell the blood on you.

21:01.580 --> 21:02.940
Did you just start your period?

21:04.470 --> 21:05.020
Yeah.

21:05.020 --> 21:06.650
How could you
touch cold water yesterday?

21:07.300 --> 21:09.180
You're used to disguising yourself
as a man,

21:09.500 --> 21:10.380
but don't forget

21:10.380 --> 21:11.500
you're a woman.

21:11.900 --> 21:13.020
That's self-responsibility.

21:14.980 --> 21:15.700
Miss Song.

21:16.300 --> 21:16.980
Thank you.

21:18.140 --> 21:19.380
I know you're kind-hearted.

21:19.940 --> 21:21.020
I trust you, actually.

21:21.820 --> 21:22.740
But I've been hiding it

21:23.300 --> 21:24.220
for years.

21:24.660 --> 21:26.380
It's become an ingrained habit.

21:27.140 --> 21:28.260
It's hard to say it out.

21:32.780 --> 21:33.340
However,

21:33.820 --> 21:34.460
one day,

21:35.780 --> 21:37.060
I'll stand openly before all

21:37.700 --> 21:39.380
as a woman,

21:40.180 --> 21:40.980
telling the world

21:42.940 --> 21:44.340
that I'm a woman,

21:44.860 --> 21:46.180
but I'm no less capable than men,

21:46.620 --> 21:47.980
and I'll become a great general.

21:49.180 --> 21:49.780
Good point.

21:50.580 --> 21:51.980
I will also prove to the world

21:52.630 --> 21:53.180
that women

21:53.340 --> 21:54.780
can practice medicine.

21:55.500 --> 21:56.540
What right do they have

21:56.540 --> 21:57.300
to criticize us?

21:57.820 --> 21:58.900
If given the choice,

21:59.260 --> 22:01.140
who would choose to be a domestic woman

22:01.140 --> 22:02.700
being judged by a man?

22:04.020 --> 22:04.620
You are

22:04.820 --> 22:06.100
an extraordinary woman.

22:09.780 --> 22:11.460
You're wise and brave.

22:19.420 --> 22:20.860
Why haven't they come yet?

22:23.900 --> 22:24.460
Huaijin.

22:25.100 --> 22:25.620
Well,

22:25.900 --> 22:26.500
since she knows

22:26.500 --> 22:27.700
He Yan is actually a woman,

22:27.980 --> 22:28.780
will she

22:29.060 --> 22:30.260
poison her in a fit of rage?

22:31.460 --> 22:32.120
She won't.

22:33.740 --> 22:34.780
How can you be sure?

22:35.060 --> 22:36.340
Didn't you see how mad she was?

22:36.580 --> 22:37.620
- She even ordered you.
- Don't worry

22:37.620 --> 22:38.550
- Be careful.
- I will.

22:38.550 --> 22:39.140
Alright.

22:46.020 --> 22:48.580
Are you two okay?

22:49.580 --> 22:50.660
We're perfectly good.

22:51.420 --> 22:52.500
Are we good, Yan?

22:52.900 --> 22:53.460
Sure.

22:53.620 --> 22:54.660
We're good.

22:55.700 --> 22:56.740
Are you alright?

22:57.300 --> 22:58.140
Are you alright?

22:58.680 --> 22:59.260
I...

23:03.700 --> 23:04.460
Are you alright?

23:07.480 --> 23:08.700
The expensive makeup artist

23:08.700 --> 23:09.660
you hired

23:10.420 --> 23:11.300
can be dismissed.

23:12.660 --> 23:13.240
I...

23:14.420 --> 23:15.060
Any objections?

23:18.060 --> 23:18.660
None.

23:20.260 --> 23:21.420
Thank you, Miss Song.

23:21.420 --> 23:21.990
Mmm.

24:41.750 --> 24:42.340
Commander.

24:42.660 --> 24:43.340
He Yan...

24:44.020 --> 24:45.300
She's a woman?

24:45.300 --> 24:46.580
Impressive.

24:46.780 --> 24:47.660
- You...
- Stop.

24:48.700 --> 24:50.340
Do you deserve to stand beside Yan?

24:50.650 --> 24:51.460
Yan?

24:51.940 --> 24:53.180
I knew Miss He

24:53.180 --> 24:54.300
much earlier than you.

24:56.500 --> 24:57.060
Commander.

24:59.660 --> 25:00.180
Commander.

25:00.700 --> 25:01.300
Well,

25:01.700 --> 25:02.660
how do I look?

25:02.940 --> 25:04.460
Will my beauty kill everyone?

25:04.820 --> 25:05.750
Kill everyone?

25:06.200 --> 25:06.980
How about

25:07.780 --> 25:08.740
I give you a sword?

25:11.740 --> 25:12.580
Board the carriage

25:12.580 --> 25:13.500
to avoid being spotted.

25:15.260 --> 25:15.800
Sure.

25:15.940 --> 25:16.820
Nobody knows

25:16.860 --> 25:17.700
you're leaving.

25:31.760 --> 25:32.390
Mmm.

25:59.540 --> 26:00.100
Sit properly.

26:00.860 --> 26:01.940
You're now Wen Yuyan,

26:01.940 --> 26:02.540
a noble lady,

26:03.180 --> 26:04.260
not a soldier.

26:05.460 --> 26:06.900
Don't fret, Yan.

26:07.180 --> 26:08.460
We have days of travel ahead.

26:08.980 --> 26:09.940
When we reach Jiyang,

26:09.940 --> 26:11.420
you'll already master the role.

26:13.140 --> 26:14.940
Since we're impersonating others,

26:15.500 --> 26:16.540
we must do it flawlessly.

26:16.780 --> 26:17.580
No slip-ups allowed.

26:18.060 --> 26:18.580
As for me,

26:18.580 --> 26:20.260
I'll reluctantly act as the steward.

26:20.860 --> 26:21.580
You

26:22.020 --> 26:23.060
clearly look like a maid.

26:23.500 --> 26:24.780
Cheng Lisu.

26:26.180 --> 26:27.300
Now that you and Huaijin

26:27.300 --> 26:28.660
are pretending to be a couple,

26:28.660 --> 26:29.540
your forms of address

26:29.940 --> 26:30.780
mustn't be neglected.

26:31.180 --> 26:32.460
You should call Huaijin honey

26:32.580 --> 26:33.100
as a wife.

26:33.420 --> 26:33.940
Naturally,

26:33.940 --> 26:35.100
Huaijin should call you honey

26:35.100 --> 26:35.620
as a husband.

26:35.780 --> 26:36.700
Why don't you practice

26:36.900 --> 26:37.620
to get accustomed?

26:40.260 --> 26:41.660
What a terrible idea!

26:42.060 --> 26:42.620
What's wrong?

26:43.140 --> 26:43.740
This is all

26:43.780 --> 26:44.780
for the task.

26:44.940 --> 26:45.860
Don't be shy.

26:46.580 --> 26:47.580
Come on. Give it a try.

26:47.860 --> 26:48.420
Try it.

26:53.300 --> 26:53.980
- Ho...
- No need.

26:57.540 --> 26:58.100
I believe

26:58.700 --> 27:00.100
you'll do well.

27:02.180 --> 27:03.660
Boring. Not fun at all.

27:12.860 --> 27:14.740
(Jiyang City)

27:34.980 --> 27:35.540
Look there.

28:09.060 --> 28:10.700
Where's Feinu?

28:11.620 --> 28:13.260
He has other matters to attend to.

28:15.180 --> 28:17.140
Then let's go to the Cui Mansion first.

28:17.380 --> 28:18.220
Once we're settled,

28:18.220 --> 28:19.350
it'll be easy to do things.

28:24.820 --> 28:26.180
What do you say,

28:27.140 --> 28:28.150
Honey?

28:33.500 --> 28:34.180
It made sense.

28:44.220 --> 28:45.560
Still no trace of Chai Anxi?

28:46.300 --> 28:46.820
Not yet.

28:47.260 --> 28:48.700
Xiao Jue's men keep watching us.

28:49.100 --> 28:50.340
It restricts our movements.

28:50.940 --> 28:51.900
Chancellor Xu gave us

28:51.900 --> 28:52.620
sufficient men.

28:52.820 --> 28:54.140
When they entered the city,
I already told them

28:54.180 --> 28:55.480
to monitor all city gates.

28:55.820 --> 28:57.500
Chai Anxi must still be in the city.

28:58.260 --> 28:59.480
Sufficient men?

28:59.820 --> 29:01.140
It seems Chancellor Xu

29:01.660 --> 29:02.900
sees Chai Anxi as a big threat.

29:03.740 --> 29:04.940
Xiao Jue has arrived.

29:05.460 --> 29:06.700
You investigate his motives.

29:07.460 --> 29:08.630
His position in Jiyang

29:08.630 --> 29:09.420
restricts him.

29:09.660 --> 29:10.340
He might come

29:10.820 --> 29:12.220
as a new identity.

29:13.580 --> 29:15.100
This time, we'll monitor Xiao Jue.

29:15.780 --> 29:16.620
Given his familiarity

29:16.620 --> 29:17.300
with Chai Anxi,

29:17.940 --> 29:19.340
he'll locate our target before us.

29:20.140 --> 29:21.660
We'll use him to get what we want.

29:22.100 --> 29:22.620
Understood.

29:28.120 --> 29:29.680
(Cui Mansion)

29:36.940 --> 29:38.620
Escort Mr. Cheng and Taotao

29:38.620 --> 29:39.930
to put luggage in the backyard.

29:40.380 --> 29:41.500
Huanqing, Yuyan,

29:41.690 --> 29:42.860
follow me, please.

29:54.140 --> 29:55.620
Master, they've arrived.

29:59.420 --> 30:01.220
Uncle.

30:04.260 --> 30:05.180
Come, Yuyan.

30:05.780 --> 30:06.940
You're truly blessed.

30:07.140 --> 30:07.660
Indeed.

30:07.780 --> 30:09.340
Huanqing and you make a perfect match.

30:09.340 --> 30:09.900
Thanks.

30:09.900 --> 30:10.580
Exactly.

30:12.220 --> 30:12.980
(Cui Yuezhi, General of Jiyang)
Wonderful.

30:12.980 --> 30:13.700
Right.

30:14.980 --> 30:15.700
Your arrival

30:15.740 --> 30:16.980
is a blessing to our family.

30:16.980 --> 30:18.540
What an outstanding man!

30:19.980 --> 30:21.820
Look at his face

30:22.300 --> 30:23.060
and his stature.

30:23.420 --> 30:24.100
He looks like me,

30:24.100 --> 30:24.900
right?

30:24.900 --> 30:25.780
Absolutely.

30:25.980 --> 30:27.740
Obviously, we're a family.

30:28.410 --> 30:29.540
You're right.

30:30.420 --> 30:31.100
I also think

30:31.420 --> 30:32.500
I look a little like you.

30:33.060 --> 30:34.550
You are uncle and nephew, after all.

30:34.820 --> 30:35.900
You two are related.

30:36.790 --> 30:37.660
Look,

30:38.260 --> 30:39.450
this is Yuyan.

30:42.580 --> 30:43.190
Uncle.

30:43.820 --> 30:44.700
Yuyan

30:44.940 --> 30:46.180
is a beautiful lady.

30:46.500 --> 30:48.150
Her future children with Huanqing

30:48.420 --> 30:50.070
will surely be stunning.

30:50.420 --> 30:51.020
True.

30:51.020 --> 30:51.540
Am I right?

30:51.620 --> 30:52.180
Yes.

30:53.050 --> 30:53.620
By the way,

30:53.820 --> 30:54.900
tomorrow at the mansion,

30:54.900 --> 30:55.860
I'll host a banquet

30:55.860 --> 30:56.820
to welcome you both.

30:57.460 --> 30:59.220
Colleagues and their families

30:59.220 --> 31:00.020
will come.

31:00.260 --> 31:01.590
It helps you make connections.

31:01.980 --> 31:02.940
I have no children,

31:03.380 --> 31:04.860
but I'll tell everyone

31:05.140 --> 31:07.130
that my family already has a successor.

31:07.540 --> 31:08.300
Thank you, Uncle.

31:09.820 --> 31:10.340
Master.

31:11.020 --> 31:12.460
Huanqing and Yuyan

31:12.780 --> 31:14.140
had an exhausting journey.

31:14.700 --> 31:16.500
Let me take them to rest first.

31:16.860 --> 31:19.260
We have plenty of time
for small talk later.

31:20.300 --> 31:21.220
Alright.

31:21.660 --> 31:22.220
Come.

31:24.140 --> 31:24.700
This way.

31:26.180 --> 31:26.740
This

31:27.100 --> 31:28.340
is the most beautiful courtyard

31:28.660 --> 31:30.060
in the mansion.

31:30.230 --> 31:30.780
Look.

31:31.300 --> 31:32.380
There are hills and rivers.

31:33.740 --> 31:34.340
Well,

31:34.780 --> 31:36.260
this is actually the best chamber

31:36.660 --> 31:37.900
in this courtyard.

31:38.900 --> 31:40.060
When I heard you were coming,

31:40.540 --> 31:41.380
I had people

31:41.780 --> 31:43.180
prepare everything well.

31:45.140 --> 31:45.660
Moreover,

31:46.540 --> 31:47.340
I specifically

31:47.580 --> 31:49.940
prepared a surprise for you.

31:51.420 --> 31:52.060
Please come in.

32:20.060 --> 32:21.080
You are

32:21.380 --> 32:22.180
a newlywed couple.

32:22.740 --> 32:24.140
I had craftsmen

32:24.140 --> 32:25.500
decorate it as a bridal chamber.

32:25.980 --> 32:26.550
Take a look.

32:26.700 --> 32:27.540
Do you like it?

32:29.980 --> 32:30.860
Thank you, Ms. Wei.

32:31.180 --> 32:32.100
I like it very much.

32:37.940 --> 32:40.570
My husband will certainly love it too.

32:46.180 --> 32:47.060
If you're pleased,

32:48.180 --> 32:48.940
so will I.

32:51.060 --> 32:52.020
I will

32:52.060 --> 32:53.460
leave you two alone.

32:53.820 --> 32:55.100
Your steward Mr. Cheng

32:55.100 --> 32:56.060
and Taotao

32:56.140 --> 32:57.940
have been properly accommodated.

32:58.380 --> 32:58.940
Thanks.

32:59.220 --> 33:00.500
- I'll take my leave now.
- Hmm.

33:04.220 --> 33:04.980
Surprise!

33:21.020 --> 33:22.300
Commander, look.

33:29.780 --> 33:30.300
Don't look.

33:32.300 --> 33:32.860
Don't look.

33:34.020 --> 33:34.620
Why not?

33:38.420 --> 33:38.980
Don't ask.

33:39.780 --> 33:40.980
But I want to see it.

33:47.740 --> 33:49.430
It's just an erotic art picture.

33:49.660 --> 33:50.900
It's nothing special.

33:50.900 --> 33:51.660
Come on.

33:51.660 --> 33:52.730
No big deal.

33:55.380 --> 33:56.140
You

33:56.780 --> 33:57.460
never feel shy.

33:58.900 --> 33:59.860
It's drawn

33:59.940 --> 34:01.060
for people, isn't it?

34:01.260 --> 34:02.220
There's no shame in it.

34:02.620 --> 34:03.420
Only hypocrites

34:03.460 --> 34:04.420
pretend to be a prude.

34:08.260 --> 34:08.920
Well,

34:09.659 --> 34:12.699
those who follow sages' teachings

34:13.060 --> 34:14.139
are true gentlemen,

34:14.580 --> 34:15.300
for example,

34:15.780 --> 34:17.340
someone like you.

34:23.860 --> 34:24.600
Oh really?

34:26.620 --> 34:27.739
Do you think

34:30.300 --> 34:31.300
a true gentleman

34:36.100 --> 34:37.100
behaves like me?

35:36.100 --> 35:36.700
Commander.

35:38.340 --> 35:38.860
Commander.

35:52.820 --> 35:53.420
Well,

35:56.140 --> 35:57.140
I haven't closely watched

35:57.340 --> 35:58.220
this yet.

35:58.260 --> 35:59.020
It's destroyed.

36:00.060 --> 36:01.300
What a pity!

36:06.420 --> 36:07.580
Shall I find an artisan

36:08.300 --> 36:09.260
to restore it for you?

36:11.980 --> 36:12.500
No need.

36:13.900 --> 36:14.500
Forget it.

36:15.020 --> 36:16.420
This drawing

36:16.580 --> 36:17.260
is not that good.

36:17.780 --> 36:18.980
I've seen superior ones.

36:19.340 --> 36:20.180
If I acquire some,

36:20.380 --> 36:21.530
I'll share them with you.

36:24.460 --> 36:25.080
Come back.

36:25.900 --> 36:26.420
Did you

36:26.420 --> 36:27.180
get any news?

36:28.440 --> 36:29.110
Commander.

36:29.700 --> 36:30.460
I contacted our men

36:30.460 --> 36:31.260
who arrived earlier.

36:31.980 --> 36:33.370
Chu Zhao hasn't located Chai Anxi.

36:33.700 --> 36:34.540
Our men also failed

36:34.540 --> 36:35.340
to find Chai Anxi.

36:36.740 --> 36:38.260
If Xu Jingfu is behind this,

36:38.620 --> 36:39.900
he will try to kill Chai Anxi.

36:40.460 --> 36:41.380
We must find Chai Anxi

36:41.780 --> 36:42.580
before he does.

36:43.700 --> 36:45.500
Chai Anxi campaigned with his father.

36:46.380 --> 36:47.510
His left leg was injured.

36:48.100 --> 36:49.300
Though he was treated,

36:49.580 --> 36:50.550
in the end,

36:50.780 --> 36:51.900
he suffered from rheumatism.

36:52.180 --> 36:53.780
Jiyang's warm, humid weather

36:54.340 --> 36:55.610
may aggravate his old injury.

36:57.180 --> 36:58.260
Monitor all apothecaries.

36:59.260 --> 36:59.820
Understood.

37:02.020 --> 37:03.620
Commander, let me help Feinu.

37:05.180 --> 37:06.360
Focus on perfecting your role

37:06.500 --> 37:07.860
as Mrs. Qiao.

37:08.420 --> 37:10.010
Don't expose us at tomorrow's banquet,

37:10.220 --> 37:11.700
or they'll drive us out of Jiyang.

37:12.540 --> 37:13.100
Don't...

37:16.180 --> 37:16.940
Don't worry.

37:17.660 --> 37:19.260
I'll do it flawlessly.

37:48.540 --> 37:50.300
Honey.

37:52.020 --> 37:53.220
I heard

37:53.500 --> 37:55.580
about what a lovely couple looks like.

37:56.220 --> 37:57.220
The husband

37:57.460 --> 37:59.300
helps his wife fill in her eyebrows.

37:59.940 --> 38:00.820
Could you

38:01.980 --> 38:03.500
do it for me?

38:12.140 --> 38:14.860
You said we mustn't expose ourselves.

38:15.300 --> 38:16.580
So, we need

38:16.900 --> 38:18.700
to act perfectly.

38:31.260 --> 38:31.820
Are you

38:32.660 --> 38:33.690
really doing my eyebrows?

38:34.020 --> 38:34.740
Are you scared?

38:35.140 --> 38:36.980
Scared? Why would I be?

38:37.860 --> 38:39.100
I just fear you'll fail.

39:11.900 --> 39:12.420
Don't move.

39:35.260 --> 39:36.300
W-What's wrong?

39:37.460 --> 39:38.260
Why

39:39.060 --> 39:40.140
is your face so red?

39:40.980 --> 39:41.500
Red?

39:43.580 --> 39:44.090
Is it?

39:46.900 --> 39:49.180
Maybe the weather here is too hot.

39:49.820 --> 39:51.220
I haven't adjusted yet.

39:51.960 --> 39:52.750
- Hmm.
- Oh.

39:53.300 --> 39:53.910
Is that so?

39:54.820 --> 39:55.860
Of course!

39:58.940 --> 40:00.020
I thought

40:00.780 --> 40:01.300
you...

40:03.860 --> 40:04.380
Well,

40:05.660 --> 40:06.300
what?

40:16.900 --> 40:17.500
Nothing.

40:18.460 --> 40:19.660
Nothing.

40:23.100 --> 40:23.820
Let's go.

40:38.380 --> 40:40.100
Wait, that's not right.

40:40.660 --> 40:43.300
The banquet doesn't start
until the afternoon.

40:56.180 --> 40:56.740
Enjoy it.

41:11.700 --> 41:12.340
Here, My lord.

41:15.180 --> 41:17.560
Jiyang,
surrounded by mountains and rivers,

41:18.140 --> 41:19.640
is easy to defend but hard to attack.

41:19.900 --> 41:21.210
To achieve a quick victory,

41:21.540 --> 41:24.380
we must storm the southern gate.

41:24.780 --> 41:25.540
Thank you

41:26.140 --> 41:27.980
for sharing the secret tunnel

41:27.980 --> 41:28.860
leading into the city.

41:29.820 --> 41:31.700
Though long abandoned,

41:31.940 --> 41:33.500
this tunnel could be useful

41:33.940 --> 41:36.660
to Wutuo.

41:37.460 --> 41:39.660
Mr. Maningbu

41:40.020 --> 41:41.500
and I are old friends.

41:42.220 --> 41:44.600
Naturally, I should help him.

41:45.060 --> 41:46.140
You're absolutely right.

41:46.500 --> 41:47.300
Mr. Maningbu

41:47.740 --> 41:49.300
sent me word the other day.

41:49.700 --> 41:50.980
He cannot visit Wei himself,

41:51.460 --> 41:54.020
but asked me to convey his gratitude.

41:56.020 --> 41:57.020
He also said

41:57.860 --> 42:00.440
if you ever need assistance,

42:01.020 --> 42:03.860
Wutuo will help without reservation.

42:05.940 --> 42:07.020
Actually,

42:07.620 --> 42:09.940
there is something

42:10.300 --> 42:12.100
I need your help with.

42:13.140 --> 42:14.060
I'm glad to help.

42:14.660 --> 42:15.830
Just say the word.

42:23.700 --> 42:25.900
A man named Chai Anxi

42:26.340 --> 42:27.980
currently resides in Jiyang.

42:28.380 --> 42:29.460
Could you

42:30.100 --> 42:32.300
get rid of him discreetly?

42:36.460 --> 42:38.620
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

42:38.720 --> 42:42.640
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

42:42.820 --> 42:44.760
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

42:44.850 --> 42:49.780
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

43:01.880 --> 43:03.290
♪I've seen the mountains♪

43:03.490 --> 43:04.900
♪And trodden through ice♪

43:05.170 --> 43:07.980
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

43:08.290 --> 43:09.680
♪Destiny is my creed♪

43:09.740 --> 43:11.140
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

43:11.290 --> 43:13.080
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

43:14.280 --> 43:15.750
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

43:15.920 --> 43:17.210
♪Gazing through the mire♪

43:17.390 --> 43:19.780
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

43:19.980 --> 43:22.030
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

43:23.160 --> 43:24.990
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

43:26.950 --> 43:29.870
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

43:29.960 --> 43:32.620
♪There must always be a longing♪

43:33.080 --> 43:38.140
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

43:38.470 --> 43:40.480
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

43:40.790 --> 43:44.440
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

43:44.680 --> 43:46.570
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

43:46.600 --> 43:50.450
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

43:50.800 --> 43:52.740
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

43:52.920 --> 43:56.750
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

43:57.000 --> 44:02.750
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

44:03.640 --> 44:09.110
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

